sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser
    participant GUI as Viser GUI (/gui)
    participant Viewer as ViserMotionViewer
    participant Adapter as DiPAdapter
    participant Subproc as Subprocess (sample.generate)
    participant DiP as Official DiP Model
    participant Decoder as Motion Decoder
    participant Scene as Viser 3D Scene

    User->>GUI: Enter text prompt & click "Generate Motion"
    GUI->>Viewer: _on_generate_clicked()
    Viewer->>Adapter: submit_job(prompt, duration, guidance, device)
    Adapter->>Adapter: State -> RUNNING
    Adapter->>Subproc: Spawn Python -m sample.generate
    Subproc->>DiP: Load checkpoint & CLIP embeddings
    DiP->>DiP: Autoregressive diffusion sampling loop
    DiP-->>Subproc: Save results.npy & results.txt
    Subproc-->>Adapter: Process exit code 0
    Adapter->>Adapter: State -> DECODING
    Adapter->>Decoder: decode_results_npy(results.npy)
    Decoder->>Decoder: Transpose (1, 22, 3, T) to (T, 22, 3)
    Decoder->>Decoder: MotionClip.validate() (bounds, topology, finite)
    Decoder-->>Adapter: Return validated MotionClip
    Adapter->>Adapter: State -> COMPLETED + Record Telemetry
    Adapter-->>Viewer: Callback on_complete(job)
    Viewer->>GUI: Update Status: "Completed in X.XXs"
    Viewer->>GUI: Update Provenance Badge: "🟢 REAL MODEL INFERENCE"
    Viewer->>Scene: Update joint & bone point handles (Frame 0)
    Viewer->>User: Playback begins in 3D viewport
